      "After the My Dinh concert, Taeyang (BigBang) continuously mentioned \"pho\" and \"the best show\"",
      "### VÂN CHI  -   11:57, Fri Oct 30, 2026 (GMT+7)",
      "<figure class=\"article-body-figure\" style=\"margin:2rem 0; text-align:center;\">\n  <img src=\"assets/images/mind_&_soul/image1.png\" alt=\"Article photo\" style=\"max-width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); display:block; margin:0 auto;\">\n  \n</figure>",
      "Taeyang (BigBang) continuously expresses his feelings for Vietnam, making Vietnamese fans happy.",
      "<figure class=\"article-body-figure\" style=\"margin:2rem 0; text-align:center;\">\n  <img src=\"assets/images/mind_&_soul/image2.jpg\" alt=\"Taeyang at BigBang's concert in My Dinh. Photo: Huyen Chi\" style=\"max-width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); display:block; margin:0 auto;\">\n  <figcaption class=\"article-body-figcaption\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-sans); font-size:0.875rem; color:var(--color-text-muted); margin-top:0.6rem; font-style:italic; line-height:1.5; text-align:center;\">Taeyang at BigBang's concert in My Dinh. Photo: Huyen Chi</figcaption>\n</figure>",
      "BIGBANG 2026–2027 World Tour in Hanoi concert took place in two nights, October 24 and 25, 2026 at My Dinh National Stadium, Hanoi.",
      "On the occasion of the group's 20th anniversary, 3 members G-Dragon, Taeyang and Daesung brought memorable performances, attracting a large number of fans and contributing to creating attraction for the Vietnamese entertainment and tourism market.",
      "On the evening of October 29, Taeyang (BigBang) posted a video and a series of behind-the-scenes photos of the concert in Vietnam, but what attracted the most attention was the accompanying caption. The voice of \"Eyes, nose, lips\" played words by replacing the word \"Pho\" with \"for\" in the paragraph.",
      "Taeyang has long loved pho after performing in Vietnam, he created interesting paragraphs with the word \"pho\" such as: \"Pho me\" (For me - for me), \"Pho all of us\" (For all of us - for all of us), \"Phogive me\" (Forgive me - forgive me), \"Pho'ever\" (Forever - forever)...",
      "Not only that, in the end of the clip, Taeyang affirmed: \"From my point of view, this is the best show! \".",
      "Taeyang's clip made Vietnamese fans' hearts flutter, and they simultaneously sent comments expressing their feelings for Taeyang as well as for BigBang.",
      "During the performance at My Dinh, Taeyang made many fans excited when he said: \"I love you guys\" in Vietnamese. He also instructed the audience to chant \"Vietnam champion!\".",
      "<figure class=\"article-body-figure\" style=\"margin:2rem 0; text-align:center;\">\n  <img src=\"assets/images/mind_&_soul/image3.jpg\" alt=\"3 members Daesung, Taeyang and G-Dragon in the BigBang concert in My Dinh. Photo: Thuy Trang.\" style=\"max-width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); display:block; margin:0 auto;\">\n  <figcaption class=\"article-body-figcaption\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-sans); font-size:0.875rem; color:var(--color-text-muted); margin-top:0.6rem; font-style:italic; line-height:1.5; text-align:center;\">3 members Daesung, Taeyang and G-Dragon in the BigBang concert in My Dinh. Photo: Thuy Trang.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
      "Taeyang (real name Dong Young-bae, born in 1988) is a famous Korean singer and dancer and one of the three members of the K-pop group BigBang.",
      "Possessing a distinctive R&B voice, impressive dance ability and attractive performance style, Taeyang not only made his mark in group activities but also built a successful solo career with many popular songs such as \"Eyes, nose, lips\", \"Ringa linga\", \"I need a girl\" and \"Vibe\" in collaboration with Jimin (BTS).",
      "As of October 2026, Taeyang has been to Vietnam twice. The first time was in June 2023, he participated in the 2023 SEEN Festival held in Hoi An, Quang Nam. During this occasion, the male singer received a lot of attention from Vietnamese fans.",
      "After more than three years, Taeyang returned to Vietnam in October 2026 with G-Dragon and Daesung within the framework of BIGBANG 2026–2027 WORLD TOUR, with two performances on October 24 and 25 at My Dinh National Stadium, Hanoi.",
      "This return not only marks a special milestone in BIGBANG's 20th anniversary journey but also an opportunity for Taeyang to meet and connect with Vietnamese fans once again."
